{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Instead of your shame, a double portion.</b> They shall inherit." "<b>And disgrace.</b> Instead of disgrace." "<b>They shall possess their portion.</b> In their portion." "Now, he has explained the word <b>mishneh</b> that he said earlier: 'Therefore in their land they shall possess a double portion.'"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 61, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:00:35.323209337Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}